---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

---
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 mx-auto px-4 py-1 max-w-6xl overflow-hidden justify-center">


        <div class="card rounded-b-2xl rounded-t-none group rolling hover:scale-105 hover:rotate-[1deg] hover:z-10 
    relative overflow-visible bg-base-200 p-6 shadow-md 
    hover:shadow-lg hover:bg-base-300 max-w-xs h-auto m-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="flex flex-row gap-2  font-semibold text-base-content">
            <Icon name="fa-solid:chalkboard-teacher" class="h-5 w-5" />
            <a aria-label="Dyma link ansible" href="https://dyma.fr/certification/6847e173cd19c9ea0c191079/653e30cc162c43e903703673" target="_blank" class="underline">Ansible</a></div>
            <div class="text-primary">
              Juillet 2025
            </div>
            <p>Via <a aria-label="Dyma" href="https://dyma.fr" target="_blank" class="underline">Dyma</a></p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 group-hover:text-primary leading-relaxed transition-colors duration-300">
            Apprentisage avancé de la technologie Ansible : playbooks, inventaires, roles, facts, gestion asynchrone des tâches, utilisation de modules communautaires... 
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 group-hover:text-primary leading-relaxed transition-colors duration-300">
            Réalisation de plusieurs projets de configuration de serveurs et de déploiement d'application web et de bases de données sur plusieurs clou dprovider (Digital Ocean et AWS).
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap m-2 gap-2">
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Ansible</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">DevOps</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Linux</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Digital Ocean</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">AWS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

<!-- <Icon name="fa-solid:award" class="h-5 w-5" /> -->
      <div class="card rounded-b-2xl rounded-t-none group rolling hover:scale-105 hover:rotate-[1deg] hover:z-10 
    relative overflow-visible bg-base-200 p-6 shadow-md 
    hover:shadow-lg hover:bg-base-300 max-w-xs h-auto m-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="flex flex-row gap-2  font-semibold text-base-content">
            <Icon name="fa-solid:chalkboard-teacher" class="h-5 w-5" />
             <a aria-label="Dyma link gitlab" href="https://dyma.fr/certification/6847e173cd19c9ea0c191079/64f5fde853b8f78052334a41" target="_blank" class="underline">Gitlab CI/CD</a></div>
            <div class="text-primary">
              Juin 2025
            </div>
            <p>Via <a aria-label="Dyma" href="https://dyma.fr" target="_blank" class="underline">Dyma</a></p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 group-hover:text-primary leading-relaxed transition-colors duration-300">
            Formation sur l'utilisation de la stack CI/CD de Gitlab. 
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 group-hover:text-primary leading-relaxed transition-colors duration-300">
            Réalisation de plusieurs projets de mise en place de pipelines CI/CD sur OVH pour des applications web.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap m-2 gap-2">
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Gitlab CI/CD</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">DevOps</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Linux</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Docker</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">OVH</span>
        </div>
      </div>  

<div class="card rounded-b-2xl rounded-t-none group rolling hover:scale-105 hover:rotate-[1deg] hover:z-10 
    relative overflow-visible bg-base-200 p-6 shadow-md 
    hover:shadow-lg hover:bg-base-300 max-w-xs h-auto m-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="flex flex-row gap-2  font-semibold text-base-content">
            <Icon name="fa-solid:chalkboard-teacher" class="h-5 w-5" />
            
            <a aria-label="Uplimit link sre google" href="https://www.credential.net/870b7049-5c8e-4b16-b3a7-97839cb979d1" target="_blank" class="underline">SRE fundamentals by Google</a></div>
            <div class="text-primary">
              Mai 2025
            </div>
            <p>Via Uplimit by <a aria-label="Salim Virgi Linkedin" href="https://linkedin.com/lasagnaboy" target="_blank" class="underline">Salim Virgi</a></p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 group-hover:text-primary leading-relaxed transition-colors duration-300">
            Apprentisage des bases du SRE selon Google : concepts clés comme les SLO, la surveillance, les alertes et la conception de systèmes fiables. 
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 group-hover:text-primary leading-relaxed transition-colors duration-300">
            Réalisation de deux projets : un sur la mise en place des SLOs et SLIs associés ; et l'autre sur la mise en place d'un système fiable.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap m-2 gap-2">
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">SRE</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">SLO/SLI/SLA</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Prometheus/Grafana</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Kubernetes</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">Monitoring</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm badge-outline group-hover:badge-ghost h-fit">System Design</span>
        </div>
      </div>  

